# yonder/rota/rota-zero-indexed.brix -- the inactive instantiation, zero-indexed. Kept for reference, not read by the live rota.
format rota-brix-v1
rota themes 8
index base zero
row 0 leo-fire
row 1 cancer-fire
row 2 leo-water
row 3 cancer-water
row 4 leo-air
row 5 cancer-air
row 6 leo-earth
row 7 cancer-earth
row-of-count rule (count - 1) mod 8
